@startuml SystemGraphVisualizer

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam padding 2
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam classFontSize 11

' ============================================================================
' SYSTEM GRAPH VISUALIZER CLASS
' ============================================================================

class SystemGraphVisualizer {
    + system: System
    + dot: Optional[Digraph]
    ==
    + __init__(system)
    + visualize(filename, format)
    + save(filepath)
}

class System {
    + name: str
    + components: Dict[str, CoSimComponent]
    + connections: List[Connection]
    + groups: Dict[str, List[CoSimComponent]]
    + execution_idx: Dict[str, int]
}

class CoSimComponent <<ABC>> {
    + name: str
    + group: Optional[str]
    + input_specs: Dict[str, PortSpec]
    + output_specs: Dict[str, PortSpec]
}

class Connection <<dataclass>> {
    + src_comp: str
    + src_port: str
    + dst_comp: str
    + dst_port: str
    + delay: int
    + unit: Optional[str]
}

class PortSpec <<port.py>> {
    + name: str
    + type: PortType
    + unit: Optional[str]
}

class Digraph <<graphviz>> {
    + comment: str
    + format: str
    + engine: str
    + graph_attr: dict
    + node_attr: dict
    + edge_attr: dict
    --
    + subgraph(name): context
    + node(name, label, **attrs)
    + edge(tail_name, head_name, **attrs)
    + render(filename, view)
}

class "Helper Functions" as Helpers <<module>> {
    + _auto_color_for_group(group_name, sat, light): str
    + _build_palette(system): Dict[str, str]
    + _record_label_for_component(comp): str
    + _edge_unit_label(sys, conn): Optional[str]
}

' Relationships
SystemGraphVisualizer -right-> System : visualizes
SystemGraphVisualizer -down-> Digraph : creates
SystemGraphVisualizer ..> Helpers : uses

System o-right-> "many" CoSimComponent : contains
System o-right-> "many" Connection : contains
CoSimComponent o-right-> "many" PortSpec
Connection ..> CoSimComponent : references
Connection ..> PortSpec : references

' Vertical arrangement
System -[hidden]down- Helpers
Digraph -[hidden]down- Helpers

' note right of SystemGraphVisualizer
'     **Graphviz-based System Visualizer**
    
'     Renders co-simulation system as:
'     - Record-shaped nodes (components)
'     - Port anchors for connections
'     - Grouped by component.group
'     - Execution order badges
'     - Unit labels on edges
'     - Delayed connections (dashed)
    
'     **Graph Attributes:**
'     - Layout: Left-to-Right (LR)
'     - Clusters for component groups
'     - Color-coded by group
' end note

' note bottom of SystemGraphVisualizer
'     **Visualization Features:**
    
'     1. **Node Structure:**
'        - Record shape with ports
'        - { inputs | name | outputs }
'        - Port anchors: <port_name>
'        - Execution gen badge (#n)
    
'     2. **Edge Rendering:**
'        - Solid: Zero delay
'        - Dashed: Delayed connections
'        - Labels: Units + delay info
'        - Port-to-port routing
    
'     3. **Grouping:**
'        - Subgraphs for each group
'        - Auto-generated pastel colors
'        - Predefined engineering palette
    
'     **Formats:** SVG, PNG, PDF
' end note

' note top of Helpers
'     **Color Generation:**
'     - MD5 hash of group name
'     - HSL -> RGB conversion
'     - Deterministic pastels
    
'     **Base Palette:**
'     - Reference: light blue
'     - Sensors: light green
'     - Control: light red
'     - Actuator: light yellow
'     - Plant: light gray
' end note

' note top of Digraph
'     **GraphViz Python API**
    
'     Declarative graph description
'     with attributes for:
'     - Graph layout (rankdir, splines)
'     - Node styling (shape, colors)
'     - Edge styling (arrows, labels)
    
'     Rendered via dot engine
' end note

@enduml